+| deal açma | — | **BAĞLI**: `open_storage_deal_with_escrow` ← `chain_actor.rs:3730` (RPC `bud_storageOpenDeal`; BUD_OPEN_DEAL_V1 imzası, CWE-294 replay koruması) | `blockchain.rs:5554` |
+| manifest kayıt | — | **BAĞLI**: `chain_actor.rs:3793` | |
